      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Review of recent evidence with translation to practice for the role of advanced practice registered nurses is presented using a case study module for the following: \"What is known about Outcomes of Patients with Low Back Pain? The study results showed that patients with low back pain may have substantial continuing pain and functional limitations. The implications and clinical relevance of these findings for advanced practice nurses are discussed highlighting best evidence."},
